<title>USA: Sun Micro Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Sun Micro Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months ended</p>
<p>			     March 30,		 March 31,</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.58		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			223,511		  143,307</p>
<p> Revs		   2,114,618		1,840,028</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 388,364		  391,486</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.35		    $0.90</p>
<p> Net			525,242		  354,052</p>
<p> Revs		   6,055,225		5,076,689</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 389,073		  392,894</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income includes $62.2 million ($0.11 per share) gain realized on the sale of an equity investment and $22.9 million ($0.04 per share) non recurring charge for purchased in-process technology in connection with an acquisition.</p>
</text>
